d a piece of glowing Ash-Fungus, which triggered a massive System Gathering Tax.\",\n      \"The tax drained her stamina to critical levels, causing a severe physical backlash and proving the local economy was rigged against standard survival.\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```",
